cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these encodings, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Probstücke Digital: TEI and MEI encodings of Johann Mattheson's Prob-Stücke (1719/1731)"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Pfeffer
    given-names: Niels
  - family-names: Rettinghaus
    given-names: Klaus
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://probstuecke-digital.de/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pfefferniels/probstuecke-data"
abstract: >-
  TEI and MEI encodings of the 24 Prob-Stücke from Johann Mattheson's
  Exemplarische Organisten-Probe (Hamburg 1719) and Grosse General-Baß-Schule
  (Hamburg 1731): the figured basses with the variants between both prints,
  diplomatic transcriptions of Mattheson's commentary, an English translation,
  lessons and realisations, and indices of persons, literature and musical
  works.
keywords:
  - Johann Mattheson
  - thoroughbass
  - figured bass
  - music theory
  - digital edition
  - TEI
  - MEI
